Follow Clean Architecture.

Rules:
- No business logic in controllers
- Use service layer for core logic
- Repository handles DB only

Coding:
- Use clear naming
- Small functions (<50 lines)
- Prefer composition over inheritance

Go:
- Use goroutines safely
- Avoid shared state
- Use context for cancellation

API:
- RESTful design
- Proper status codes
- JSON responses only

Logging:
- Structured logging
- Always include traceId

Performance:
- Avoid unnecessary DB calls
- Use caching when needed